/**
 * Wowoni Site Centralized Stylesheet (main.css)
 * Consolidated CSS for all pages across the Wowoni corporate application:
 * 1. Global Design Tokens & Variables
 * 2. Shared Header & Navigation
 * 3. Shared Footer
 * 4. Shared Reveal Animations & Global Utilities
 * 5. Home Page (index-4.html)
 * 6. Services Overview (services/service.html)
 * 7. Digital Transformation (services/digital-transformation.html)
 * 8. Elite IT Resources (services/elite-it-resources.html)
 * 9. Testing Services (services/testing-services.html)
 * 10. Careers (career/career.html)
 * 11. Open Positions (career/open-positions.html)
